From: Yaoming Chen <cc201008@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: sync PPE UPDMEM egress MAC for offloaded IPv6 flows

airoha: 收录 IPv6 UPDMEM 修复(专用 UPDMEM 锁版)

路由式 IPv6 FOE 条目不内联出向源 MAC, 硬件按 smac_id 查 UPDMEM 表;
该表仅在 probe 时写入端口自身地址。PON 多服务 VLAN 场景下会话源
MAC 与端口地址不同(offload 后源 MAC 过期), IPv6 帧被上游静默丢弃,
表现为 offload 接管后传输停摆。IPv4 HNAPT 条目内联 MAC 不受影响。

修复: 路由式 IPv6 条目写 smac_id 前, 将该流实际使用的出向源 MAC
编程进 UPDMEM 槽位。

两处 UPDMEM 写入者(airoha_set_macaddr 的 ndo_open/ndo_set_mac_address
路径, 与 flowtable offload 路径)以 airoha_ppe_init_upd_mem() 内置的
专用叶子锁串行化: ndo 路径仅持 RTNL, offload 路径持
flow_offload_mutex, 且 airoha_enable_qos_for_gdm34() 持
flow_offload_mutex 调用 airoha_set_macaddr()——在调用方加锁会
自死锁, 叶子锁覆盖全部写入者且无重入风险。

Fixes: 00a7678310fe3 ("net: airoha: Introduce flowtable offload support")
Signed-off-by: Yaoming Chen <cc201008@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c | 40 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 40 insertions(+)

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c
@@ -518,6 +518,19 @@
 				val |= FIELD_PREP(AIROHA_FOE_IB2_NBQ, channel);
 
 			smac_id = port->id;
+			/*
+			 * Routed IPv6 entries resolve the egress source MAC
+			 * through the UPDMEM table indexed by smac_id. The
+			 * egress netdev can legally carry a different address
+			 * than the GDM port itself: on PON setups the
+			 * authentication MAC lives on the pon device while
+			 * each service VLAN routes with its own address. Keep
+			 * the table entry in sync with the source address this
+			 * flow is actually going to use.
+			 */
+			if (type >= PPE_PKT_TYPE_IPV6_ROUTE_3T)
+				airoha_ppe_init_upd_mem(dev,
+							data->eth.h_source);
 		}
 	}
 
@@ -2143,10 +2156,22 @@
 
 void airoha_ppe_init_upd_mem(struct airoha_gdm_dev *dev, const u8 *addr)
 {
+	static DEFINE_MUTEX(updmem_lock);
+
 	struct airoha_gdm_port *port = dev->port;
 	struct airoha_eth *eth = dev->eth;
 	u32 val;
 
+	/*
+	 * The flowtable offload path programs the same UPDMEM slot with the
+	 * per-flow egress source MAC (airoha_ppe_foe_entry_prepare()), while
+	 * the ndo_open/ndo_set_mac_address paths program the port address.
+	 * Both use a two-step DATA/CTRL sequence that must not interleave:
+	 * serialize them here. This lock is a leaf: never acquire
+	 * flow_offload_mutex while holding it.
+	 */
+	mutex_lock(&updmem_lock);
+
 	val = (addr[2] << 24) | (addr[3] << 16) | (addr[4] << 8) | addr[5];
 	airoha_fe_wr(eth, REG_UPDMEM_DATA(0), val);
 	airoha_fe_wr(eth, REG_UPDMEM_CTRL(0),
@@ -2159,6 +2184,8 @@
 		     FIELD_PREP(PPE_UPDMEM_ADDR_MASK, port->id) |
 		     FIELD_PREP(PPE_UPDMEM_OFFSET_MASK, 1) |
 		     PPE_UPDMEM_WR_MASK | PPE_UPDMEM_REQ_MASK);
+
+	mutex_unlock(&updmem_lock);
 }
 
 struct airoha_ppe_dev *airoha_ppe_get_dev(struct device *dev)
